{
  "about": "Animal records (profile veilcore/profile/animal-individual/v1, SPEC 11.8, draft). The fingerprint is computed exactly as for any record (SPEC 3.6.1 and 4.4): contentHash = SHA-256 of the canonical serialisation of fields; fingerprint = H(\"veilcore:v1:keyrecord\", keyBinding, contentHash) when fields has keyBinding, else contentHash. The profile adds validation only: a record in `refusals` must be refused before it is sealed or stored. `appRecord` is the VeilCore site's own stored shape for the same record (informational: an implementation that reads only `fields` can ignore it). All animals, names, IDs and farms are test data.",
